    exact (h1.mul h2.measurable).aestronglyMeasurable

/-- Blueprint lines 2984-2992, integrated in `x`: for `f₀` bounded measurable supported in
`[-T, T]` and `C¹` inputs `f₁, f₂, f₃` with values and derivatives bounded by `M` and `f₁`
